    "LocalizationKey": "Advanced_Copper_Tools_CopperStove_Placed_CardHelpSection",
    "DefaultText": "<b>Usage:</b> A placed metal stove functioning as a fireplace that holds 600 weight, like a campfire: one cooking pot or two clay bowls. Gives Sanctuary by metal: +75 copper or Tin Bronze, +80 Ghost Bronze, +65 Tin, +90 White Bronze. Accepts oak wood, twigs, or charcoal as fuel. Pick up to move; the fuel and the metal go with it."
  },
